    {
      "id": "Pq0QFhoJUxE09Yiw66TqC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 394.333251953125,
      "y": 2329.4999389648438,
      "width": 720.7759399414062,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "wS0-skolY7VemccXHztBv"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2080898120,
      "version": 579,
      "versionNonce": 1761005056,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780824393033,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 把h1传入到commitWork中，获取h1的父节点也就是div\n2. 把当前h1挂载到div中，之后遍历子节点，挂载文本节点\n3. 处理当前fiber节点的兄弟节点，也就是p节点\n4. 把p节点挂载到父节点身上，也就是div",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 把h1传入到commitWork中，获取h1的父节点也就是div\n2. 把当前h1挂载到div中，之后遍历子节点，挂载文本节点\n3. 处理当前fiber节点的兄弟节点，也就是p节点\n4. 把p节点挂载到父节点身上，也就是div",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oTqILDxt8ZsfH8SXPdYQz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1110.6666870117188,
      "y": 2116.8333740234375,
      "width": 529.423828125,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "wS0-skolY7VemccXHztBv"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1846348856,
      "version": 145,
      "versionNonce": 1629819392,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780824393033,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "function commitWork(fiber) {\n    if (!fiber) {\n        return\n    }\n\n    const domParent = fiber.parent.dom\n    domParent.appendChild(fiber.dom)\n    commitWork(fiber.child)\n    commitWork(fiber.sibling)\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "function commitWork(fiber) {\n    if (!fiber) {\n        return\n    }\n\n    const domParent = fiber.parent.dom\n    domParent.appendChild(fiber.dom)\n    commitWork(fiber.child)\n    commitWork(fiber.sibling)\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
