    {
      "id": "Q7761fDgduiQHNiqCAuDz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 381.3333435058594,
      "y": 2624.499969482422,
      "width": 376.03985595703125,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "WfKdn2aSRarVKS7eOmFgS"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ax4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 304729600,
      "version": 168,
      "versionNonce": 1291406848,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780824397211,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "<div>\n    <App>\n        <h1> hello </h1>\n        <Home>\n            <h2> world </h2>\n        </Home>\n    </App>\n</div>",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "<div>\n    <App>\n        <h1> hello </h1>\n        <Home>\n            <h2> world </h2>\n        </Home>\n    </App>\n</div>",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2BdVh97V3qCS22EpbigRG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1104.3333129882812,
      "y": 2552.4999389648438,
      "width": 662.8436889648438,
      "height": 490,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "WfKdn2aSRarVKS7eOmFgS"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ax8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1303974400,
      "version": 105,
      "versionNonce": 1017089536,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780824397211,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "function commitDeletion(fiber,domParent) {\n    if(fiber.dom) {\n        domParent.removeChild(fiber.dom)\n    } else {\n        commitDeletion(fiber.child,domParent)\n\n        let node = fiber.child\n        while(node.sibling) {\n            commitDeletion(node.sibling,domParent)\n\n            node = node.sibling\n        }\n    }\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "function commitDeletion(fiber,domParent) {\n    if(fiber.dom) {\n        domParent.removeChild(fiber.dom)\n    } else {\n        commitDeletion(fiber.child,domParent)\n\n        let node = fiber.child\n        while(node.sibling) {\n            commitDeletion(node.sibling,domParent)\n\n            node = node.sibling\n        }\n    }\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aJicOuqZ7ieA9YcAG4Ehn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 388.9998474121094,
      "y": 2982.8333129882812,
      "width": 1095.247802734375,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "WfKdn2aSRarVKS7eOmFgS"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "axG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1878774272,
      "version": 885,
      "versionNonce": 1568525824,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780824397211,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 把 App 作为 fiber 传进去，div作为domParent\n2. fiber.dom 不存在，进入else分支，把h1和div传进去\n3. h1是存在的，直接删除就好，执行完后该函数返回\n4. node = h1，h1的兄弟节点就是Home是存在\n5. Home传入，div传入；Home不存在dom，接着往下找子元素，也就是h2\n6. h2存在则删除，返回；注意这只是第一波返回，将h2赋值给node，不存在再退出执行\n7. Home不存在兄弟节点，退出",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 把 App 作为 fiber 传进去，div作为domParent\n2. fiber.dom 不存在，进入else分支，把h1和div传进去\n3. h1是存在的，直接删除就好，执行完后该函数返回\n4. node = h1，h1的兄弟节点就是Home是存在\n5. Home传入，div传入；Home不存在dom，接着往下找子元素，也就是h2\n6. h2存在则删除，返回；注意这只是第一波返回，将h2赋值给node，不存在再退出执行\n7. Home不存在兄弟节点，退出",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
